pkcs11: add rsa_pkcs_mechanism option

AWS KMS's PKCS#11 provider implements CKM_RSA_PKCS, but not CKM_RSA_X_509.
Allow callers to request CKM_RSA_PKCS while retaining the upstream default.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE-specific]

